1
00:00:48,970 --> 00:00:53,030
[The Old Story of Yu Hong]

2
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:55,830
[Episode 9]

3
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:57,650
Does that feel good?

4
00:00:59,570 --> 00:01:00,210
It does.

5
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,700
Feels good? Call me hubby then.

6
00:01:02,970 --> 00:01:03,670
What did you say?

7
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:05,200
Call me hubby.

8
00:01:07,290 --> 00:01:08,590
Call me hubby!

9
00:01:10,970 --> 00:01:12,780
What the hell are you doing?

10
00:01:13,870 --> 00:01:15,140
Why'd you kick me?

11
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,830
What are you doing?

12
00:01:18,090 --> 00:01:19,140
Are you crazy?

13
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:22,500
What's wrong? We weren't finished.

14
00:01:23,620 --> 00:01:24,570
W-What are you doing?

15
00:01:24,570 --> 00:01:26,130
What the hell is this?

16
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,310
You can go.

17
00:01:27,770 --> 00:01:28,860
I'm not doing business with you anymore.

18
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:29,810
No, no, no.

19
00:01:30,970 --> 00:01:32,800
Fine, you don't have to call me hubby.
No need. No need.

20
00:01:33,090 --> 00:01:35,280
Okay, okay. We weren't finished.

21
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:37,340
I'm still in the mood.

22
00:01:37,340 --> 00:01:39,110
We weren't finished. It's not over yet.

23
00:01:39,140 --> 00:01:40,310
What the hell are you doing?

24
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,289
Oh, my God.

25
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:44,310
W-What's going on here?

26
00:01:45,210 --> 00:01:46,759
How could you... We weren't finished

27
00:01:46,759 --> 00:01:48,350
and you just kicked me out?

28
00:01:48,729 --> 00:01:50,070
How could you do that?

29
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:52,740
Don't you have any professional ethics?

30
00:01:52,900 --> 00:01:54,759
Nobody does business like this!

31
00:01:55,710 --> 00:01:56,979
Don't push me too far.

32
00:01:57,759 --> 00:01:59,910
If you piss me off,
I'll burn this whole place down.

33
00:02:00,230 --> 00:02:01,620
That'll teach you to act cocky.

34
00:02:01,620 --> 00:02:02,790
Did you hear me?

35
00:02:07,650 --> 00:02:08,970
What's going on here?

36
00:02:09,710 --> 00:02:11,520
I didn't even say anything.

37
00:02:12,210 --> 00:02:13,250
What's wrong with you?

38
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:18,680
What's gotten into you?

39
00:02:20,030 --> 00:02:21,370
Why are you crying?

40
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,090
All right, calm down.

41
00:02:23,650 --> 00:02:24,180
Don't cry anymore.

42
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:27,150
It's nothing. What are you crying for?

43
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:28,210
Go out the back door.

44
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:34,710
What's going on here?

45
00:02:37,930 --> 00:02:38,840
You're like an actress.

46
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,370
You can cry on cue, then laugh on cue.

47
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:42,710
Have you lost your mind or something?

48
00:02:43,470 --> 00:02:45,210
You're just taking me for granted
because I like you so much.

49
00:02:45,210 --> 00:02:46,020
I'm telling you.

50
00:02:46,530 --> 00:02:47,650
You just keep pushing your luck.

51
00:02:49,620 --> 00:02:51,630
What the hell is going on every day?

52
00:02:58,560 --> 00:03:00,060
Every one of you

53
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:02,150
needs a good beating.

54
00:03:16,810 --> 00:03:17,500
Hello.

55
00:03:19,060 --> 00:03:20,650
Page 3565 for me.

56
00:03:20,650 --> 00:03:21,590
Page it 10 times.

57
00:03:21,590 --> 00:03:22,800
Come to the square and pick me up ASAP.

58
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,290
If you're late, I'll kick your ass.

59
00:03:24,690 --> 00:03:25,300
Right.

60
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:55,940
Kill bugs, kill ants, kill rats!

61
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,200
Roaches and ants, wipe them all out!

62
00:03:58,430 --> 00:04:00,490
If the rats don't die, I'll die!

63
00:04:00,710 --> 00:04:01,990
A secret formula passed down
for generations.

64
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:04,250
The rats' worst enemy. Works like a charm!

65
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,450
Fine ingredients, expertly combined!

66
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,440
Colorless, odorless, and eco-friendly.

67
00:04:09,020 --> 00:04:10,780
One bite, and the rat is dead.

68
00:04:10,780 --> 00:04:12,850
Big rats, little rats,
they'll all be gone!

69
00:04:13,250 --> 00:04:14,750
No mess, no fuss.

70
00:04:14,750 --> 00:04:16,670
Clean and easy, no more worries.

71
00:04:16,870 --> 00:04:18,570
Everyone who's tried it swears by it.

72
00:04:18,890 --> 00:04:20,829
The whole neighborhood
gives it two thumbs up!

73
00:04:21,310 --> 00:04:24,210
Kill bugs, kill ants, kill rats!

74
00:05:21,230 --> 00:05:22,360
I'll beat you to a pulp!

75
00:05:37,540 --> 00:05:38,480
Once the contract's done,

76
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:39,770
take it to the accounting department.

77
00:05:40,980 --> 00:05:42,800
Once you've reviewed it,
just put it on my desk.

78
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:45,830
You had to call me
about this little thing?

79
00:05:45,830 --> 00:05:46,490
All right.

80
00:05:47,130 --> 00:05:48,130
I'm here, I'm here. Gotta go.

81
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:55,860
You little punk.

82
00:05:56,690 --> 00:05:57,450
Get in my way again,

83
00:05:57,450 --> 00:05:59,000
and I'll smash you to pieces. Got it?

84
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,810
Got it, got it, Mr. Li.

85
00:06:01,810 --> 00:06:02,800
Every damn day...

86
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:04,330
Easy, Mr. Li.

87
00:06:31,540 --> 00:06:32,420
You're back.

88
00:06:33,830 --> 00:06:34,830
Have some porridge.

89
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,570
Where are you going?

90
00:06:56,630 --> 00:06:58,420
I'm getting you some side dishes.

91
00:06:59,890 --> 00:07:01,290
Are you avoiding me?

92
00:07:02,270 --> 00:07:03,240
Why would I avoid you?

93
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,510
You're my man.

94
00:07:08,100 --> 00:07:08,920
Then call me hubby.

95
00:07:10,420 --> 00:07:11,690
Call me hubby!

96
00:07:14,010 --> 00:07:14,750
Hubby?

97
00:07:18,010 --> 00:07:19,380
That's more like it.

98
00:07:22,790 --> 00:07:23,610
Call me hubby!

99
00:07:24,620 --> 00:07:25,100
Say it!

100
00:07:26,270 --> 00:07:28,250
Call me hubby! Call me hubby!

101
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,390
Say it! Say it! Say it!

102
00:07:30,390 --> 00:07:31,870
Say it! Say it! Say it!

103
00:07:35,140 --> 00:07:36,280
Call me hubby...

104
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,270
Say it!

105
00:07:45,980 --> 00:07:48,130
I-I'm busy here.

106
00:07:49,170 --> 00:07:50,250
How many people do you have there?

107
00:07:51,190 --> 00:07:52,070
Just waiting on me?

108
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:54,430
Okay, okay, okay.

109
00:07:54,630 --> 00:07:55,570
Coming, coming, coming.

110
00:07:55,930 --> 00:07:57,500
Just wait till I wipe the floor
with you guys.

111
00:07:58,420 --> 00:07:59,190
Just wait!

112
00:13:25,290 --> 00:13:28,100
[Meet at our usual place.]

113
00:13:38,530 --> 00:13:39,410
Tired?

114
00:13:44,220 --> 00:13:44,840
What's wrong?

115
00:13:45,030 --> 00:13:46,130
I don't wanna talk to you.

116
00:13:47,750 --> 00:13:48,960
What's gotten into you?

117
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:53,920
I know you

118
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:55,750
hate me.

119
00:13:56,220 --> 00:13:58,150
You'd love nothing more
than to see me dead.

120
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:01,770
But if I die by your hand,

121
00:14:01,770 --> 00:14:03,010
that's exactly how I'd want to go.

122
00:14:14,750 --> 00:14:15,550
What's

123
00:14:15,570 --> 00:14:17,260
with all the sighing?

124
00:14:21,550 --> 00:14:22,890
I'm happy.

125
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:27,510
You call that happy?

126
00:14:36,100 --> 00:14:37,120
It's just...

127
00:14:39,100 --> 00:14:40,600
I feel like I won't be happy
for much longer.

128
00:14:42,270 --> 00:14:44,220
What are you talking about?

129
00:14:44,870 --> 00:14:45,740
All right, all right, all right.

130
00:14:47,340 --> 00:14:48,910
Did that asshole hit you again?

131
00:14:52,570 --> 00:14:53,440
Where did he hit you? Let me see.

132
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:54,010
Let me see.

133
00:14:54,010 --> 00:14:54,860
Go away, go away, go away.

134
00:14:54,860 --> 00:14:56,030
Let me see. What are you...

135
00:14:56,030 --> 00:14:57,200
Now you want to take a look?

136
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,150
I'm no man.

137
00:15:15,250 --> 00:15:16,270
It's not your fault.

138
00:15:16,950 --> 00:15:18,410
What does it have to do with you?

139
00:15:19,790 --> 00:15:21,130
I guess I was just born unlucky.

140
00:15:29,730 --> 00:15:30,730
Trust me.

141
00:15:31,250 --> 00:15:32,720
One day, I'll take you away.

142
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:33,870
Then no one will ever find us.

143
00:15:44,480 --> 00:15:46,120
I'm not afraid of him.

144
00:15:49,090 --> 00:15:50,100
I'm scared...

145
00:15:55,390 --> 00:15:56,170
Scared of what?

146
00:16:04,200 --> 00:16:05,240
I'm sick.

147
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:07,890
Oh...

148
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:09,870
Is it contagious?

149
00:16:15,410 --> 00:16:17,460
No, I mean, is it serious?

150
00:16:17,460 --> 00:16:18,560
Don't worry.

151
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:20,600
My illness only affects women, not men.

152
00:16:20,870 --> 00:16:21,820
Don't. Don't.

153
00:16:21,820 --> 00:16:22,820
Don't get mad.

154
00:16:24,370 --> 00:16:25,720
Look at you...

155
00:16:27,150 --> 00:16:28,390
What's there to be afraid of
when you're sick?

156
00:16:28,390 --> 00:16:29,840
We'll just get you treated.

157
00:16:31,010 --> 00:16:32,140
So what kind of illness do you have?

158
00:16:34,010 --> 00:16:35,290
I'm talking to you.

159
00:16:35,370 --> 00:16:36,130
It's a woman's problem.

160
00:16:36,130 --> 00:16:37,800
Why are you asking?

161
00:16:38,070 --> 00:16:39,270
You wouldn't understand
even if I told you.

162
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,630
I've seen a doctor.

163
00:16:43,290 --> 00:16:44,500
The doctor said it won't kill me.

164
00:16:47,650 --> 00:16:48,630
But it's not easy to cure.

165
00:16:55,740 --> 00:16:56,620
However...

166
00:16:57,220 --> 00:16:58,580
The doctor did say

167
00:16:59,530 --> 00:17:00,580
there's a folk remedy.

168
00:17:02,020 --> 00:17:02,840
What remedy?

169
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:18,010
The doctor said

170
00:17:18,700 --> 00:17:19,900
I need to get a snake.

171
00:17:20,619 --> 00:17:21,890
The more venomous, the better.

172
00:17:22,750 --> 00:17:24,310
Fight poison with poison.
You know what I mean?

173
00:17:27,349 --> 00:17:28,770
Wait, isn't this a Cantonese restaurant?

174
00:17:28,770 --> 00:17:30,580
How come you serve
pork stew from Northeast China too?

175
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:31,700
Don't get me started.

176
00:17:31,700 --> 00:17:32,680
Back in the day,

177
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,900
people just wanted to try something new.

178
00:17:33,900 --> 00:17:35,960
But who eats this stuff these days?

179
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,330
If I hadn't started serving
pork stew from Northeast China,

180
00:17:37,330 --> 00:17:38,240
I'm telling you, this place

181
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:39,310
would've gone under.

182
00:17:39,310 --> 00:17:40,850
I heard from Fatty Li

183
00:17:41,740 --> 00:17:44,270
that he had snake soup
at a Cantonese restaurant.

184
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:46,920
He even drank that kind of liquor

185
00:17:48,160 --> 00:17:49,610
mixed with snake venom.

186
00:17:50,660 --> 00:17:52,170
Is anyone still eating snake these days?

187
00:17:50,720 --> 00:17:53,890
[Pay Attention to Hygiene]

188
00:17:52,330 --> 00:17:53,250
Back in the day,

189
00:17:53,250 --> 00:17:54,880
these business owners liked to show off

190
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:56,610
and would splurge on all-snake banquets.

191
00:17:56,610 --> 00:17:57,920
But look at things now.

192
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,500
People are getting laid off,
businesses are going under.

193
00:17:59,500 --> 00:18:01,230
Who's got money to spend on this stuff?

194
00:18:01,380 --> 00:18:02,010
You know,

195
00:18:02,010 --> 00:18:03,550
I bought a snake last month,

196
00:18:03,550 --> 00:18:04,750
and I still haven't sold it.

197
00:18:04,750 --> 00:18:05,700
If you like it,

198
00:18:05,700 --> 00:18:07,000
I'll sell it to you at a loss.

199
00:18:07,700 --> 00:18:08,920
Come, come, come.

200
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:09,510
Where is it?

201
00:18:09,510 --> 00:18:11,310
Let me show you. Where is it...

202
00:18:13,290 --> 00:18:13,980
Here.

203
00:18:15,310 --> 00:18:16,350
Is this thing venomous?

204
00:18:17,450 --> 00:18:18,300
Very venomous.
